50:[$FFB1B9]Dyron[$ffffff]: I need to find Iris. I'm sure she'll know what to do.
51:Find and talk to Iris. The serf in red clothes.|Don't get caught by the patrols.
52:[$FFB1B9]Dyron[$ffffff]: Iris is probably moving around the camp.
53:[$FFB1B9]Dyron[$ffffff]: I finally found you.
54:[$0909F6]Unknown Woman[$ffffff]: Who are you??
55:[$FFB1B9]Dyron[$ffffff]: Sorry, I mistook you for someone else. You look very similar.
56:[$0909F6]Barbarian[$ffffff]: What are you doing here, you scoundrel! These lands belong to the Tribe of Distillon!
57:[$0909F6]Barbarian[$ffffff]: You're not allowed here!